# MONKCRAFT GIFTING CO

## Business
Build a premium, India-focused corporate gifting platform supporting 4,000+ products, intelligent discovery, personalization, bulk ordering, and employee gifting stores.

## Visual identity
- Primary creative reference: Hustlemad Website Re-Design (Corporate Gifting) 2023 on Behance.
- Create an original identity with similarly polished, colourful, playful, cartoon-illustrated art direction.
- Avoid generic templates, stock photography, generic AI-generated images, and boring corporate aesthetics.
- Use actual supplied product images and verified product information only.
- Never invent prices, specifications, inventory, customer testimonials, or business claims.
- A separate visual design rule will define detailed art direction later.

## Customer experience
- Prioritize effortless navigation, fast search, accessibility, responsiveness, and customer trust.
- Support discovery by gifting occasion, quantity, budget, and customization needs.
- Keep interfaces intuitive, refined, and visually consistent.

## Development rules
- The project owner is a beginner. Explain instructions simply.
- Work on one small, clearly defined task at a time.
- Present a plan before significant changes and wait for approval.
- Inspect existing files before modifying them.
- Never invent dependencies, APIs, or completed functionality.
- Do not install packages, force updates, delete files, or deploy without approval.
- Do not expose secrets or commit sensitive credentials.
- Run relevant checks after changes and report actual results.
- Preserve working functionality.
- Recommend a Git checkpoint after each approved milestone.
- Do not build unrequested pages or features.---
